        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 95-CW, 4-3/4\" x 9\" Wrap Around Plate for Marks and Medco Levers</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis wrap around plate protects your doors from entry tools and tampering. 2.125 Inch Bore Hole has special cut-outs specifically designed for Marks and Medco Style Levers. It is 4.750 inches wide and 9 inches high with a 2.750 inch backset. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with <a href=\"/collections/pdq-commercial-locks\">PDQ Commercial Lever Locks</a>, <a href=\"/collections/global-lock-sets\">Imperial USA Commercial Lever Locks</a>, and <a href=\"/collections/deltana-levers-knobs-and-locks\">Deltana Commercial Lever Locks</a>.\r\n\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"2\" border=0\" class=\"text\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Don-Jo 95-CW Features:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Steel 22 gauge (.032) construction</l>\r\n<li>Assorted finishes available</li>\r\n<li>Built-in stainless steel threaded insert for tube latch</li>\r\n<li>Long lasting and secure mounting of latch and bolt</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty stainless steel trim screws</li>\r\n<li>Permanent holding power eliminates loosening of latch mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications </b> of the Don-Jo 95-CW Wrap Around Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Face Plate Width: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Edge Plate Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-95-CW-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262404\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 95-CW Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-95CW-Specifications.gif?v=1704354640\" width=\"293\" height=\"253\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 95-CW Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
